Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:01.36,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Vice City vuelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.38,0:00:04.03,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Pero no es la Vice\NCity que recuerdas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:08.14,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}En 2002, GTA Vice\NCity nos llevó a 1986:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.16,0:00:11.05,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}neones, trajes\Nblancos, música
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:13.70,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}ochentera y\NTommy Vercetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.07,0:00:17.44,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}En 2006, Vice City\NStories volvió a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:20.75,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}la misma ciudad,\Nesta vez en 1984.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:23.65,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Y ahora GTA 6 la\Ntrae a la actualidad:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:26.56,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}en los tráileres hay\Nmóviles, redes sociales
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:28.86,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}y vídeos virales\Npor todas partes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.23,0:00:31.82,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Mismo espíritu, el\Nde Miami, pero con
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:34.68,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}otra escala y dentro\Nde un estado entero:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:35.45,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Leonida.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:37.23,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}¿Jugaste al de 2002?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.25,0:00:38.78,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Dímelo en comentarios.
